# Spectacular Spider-Man's second ability grants hexproof and indestructible until end of turn to the creatures its
# controller has when it resolves, which is layer 6. It pays for that by sacrificing itself as a cost, so the ability
# resolves with its own source already in the graveyard and never grants anything to it.
#
# Bot2 casts Wrath of God on turn 8. Bot1 holds priority and activates in response; the Giver of Runes is
# indestructible when "destroy all creatures" resolves and lives, while the Spider-Man is in the graveyard from the
# cost rather than from the Wrath. On turn 9 the grant is gone and the Giver is an ordinary creature again.

